ds","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20can%20be%20carried,tree%20is%20their%20anchor.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e4","era":null,"summary":"Gvar Barzeel and dozens of Kolaghan warriors enter the chamber, and Anafenza calls on the tree's ancestors.","participants":["gvar-barzeel","anafenza","kolaghan","kin-tree"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":493,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":71,"quote":"Spirits of this tree, ancestors of my people, your descendants need you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20of%20this%20tree%2C,your%20descendants%20need%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20of%20this%20tree%2C,your%20descendants%20need%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e7","era":null,"summary":"Oret's scalelord lands in the chamber, crushing the kin-tree and learning of Anafenza's necromancy.","participants":["oret-s-scalelord","anafenza","oret","kin-tree"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":493,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"D