zan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Which%20Cemil%2C%20assistant%20to,The%20betrayal%20was%20unthinkable.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=Which%20Cemil%2C%20assistant%20to,The%20betrayal%20was%20unthinkable.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms-e15","era":null,"summary":"Jurjis declares that he will take a cutting of the Kin-Tree because his house has been refused one, and the two fight.","participants":["jurjis","mehtma","kin-tree","house-agach"],"location":"qatros-karst","importance":"major","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","order":944,"story_date":"2025-03-03","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":117,"quote":"But my house has been refused a Kin-Tree for too long.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=But%20my%20house%20has,Kin%2DTree%20for%20too%20long.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2025-03-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-abzan-siege-blossoms#:~:text=But%20my%20house%20has,Kin%2DTree%20for%20too%20long.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Abzan: Siege Blossoms\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic